# Lolo Pilo - Unified Social Visit & Optional Street Game Timeline
# Voice: Joyful, spry 1968 plaza champion Duwende. Zero time-of-day words. Zero em-dashes.

label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	LoloPilo: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	LoloPilo: Ho-ho! Just resting my boots under your awning, apo. Best breeze on the road!
	LoloPilo: Brought my game pouch along in case your hands want a quick break from counting coins!
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	LoloPilo: O, apo! Quiet stretch on the half-court, so I hopped over to check on your counter.
	LoloPilo: Care for a friendly round with the sixty-eight plaza champ?
else:
	LoloPilo: Hehe, caught you standing still behind that register again, apo!
	LoloPilo: Spare a minute for a quick street game to keep the good luck rolling?
- Sure Lolo, let's play!
	LoloPilo: Ho-ho, eyes sharp now! Show me what you've got, apo!
	[signal arg="minigame:lolo_pilo_random"]
	if {Transaction_MinigameWon}:
		LoloPilo: Bravo, apo! Quick wrists and sharp eyes, your Lola would be beaming!
	else:
		LoloPilo: Haha, good match! Still takes practice to dethrone the mound champion, apo!
- Hands are full right now, Lolo.
	LoloPilo: Duty first, apo! Keep those shelves tidy and save me a rematch next visit!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	LoloPilo: Watching neighbors pass your counter reminds me of the old fiesta crowds, apo.
	LoloPilo: Alright, back to the mango mound I go. Stretch your legs soon, ha!
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	LoloPilo: A little play keeps mortal and duwende hearts young alike, apo!
	LoloPilo: Keep your eyes peeled for my next challenge!
else:
	LoloPilo: Hehe, if your broom moves an inch by itself, don't blame me, apo!
	LoloPilo: Take care behind that counter!
[end_timeline]
